# No Left Accent Side Lines

Never add a colored vertical accent bar on the left edge of cards, callouts, panels, alerts, or verdict boxes.

## Forbidden

- `border-l-4`, `border-l-[N]`, or similar left accent borders used as status/severity decoration
- Classes like `border-l-red-500`, `border-l-amber-500`, `border-l-blue-500`, `border-l-emerald-500` on card containers
- Pseudo-element or absolute-positioned left stripes that mimic this pattern

## Preferred

- Plain cards (`card`, normal `border border-slate-200`)
- Convey status with icons, text color, badges, or background tints — not a left side line

## Exception

Hierarchy/indent borders inside nested lists (e.g. tree rows) are fine when they indicate nesting, not card severity.
